    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], τό, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oyster-green,
				Ulva Lactuca</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. θαλάσσιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				591b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.98
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				52
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β.</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				792
			</span></i>; also, a <i>marsh-plant</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				415
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tree-moss, Usnea barbata</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>liverwort, Marchantia polymorpha</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>clustering male blossom of the hazel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				624a34
			</span></i>: generally, <i>catkin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				71
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				898
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυκαλίς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
			</span></i> ap. Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.139
			</span></i>.</div>
